  data: {
    LLM: "Eight rounds played in sequence: 1. **No Tricks**: -1 pt per trick won. 2. **No Hearts**: -1 pt per Heart captured. 3. **No Queens (Jacks)**: -4 pts per Queen (or Jack) captured. 4. **No King of Hearts**: -8 pts for capturing the King of Hearts (The 'Hairy' King). 5. **No Last Trick**: -8 pts for winning the last trick. 6. **The Lora**: A shedding round. Players play cards in sequences (like Fan-Tan). First to empty their hand wins points. 7. **Negative Lora**: Inverse of round 6. 8. **Double Negative**: Points from all previous rounds combined into one super-avoidance round.",
    Player: "Eight rounds played in sequence: 1. **No Tricks**: -1 pt per trick won. 2. **No Hearts**: -1 pt per Heart captured. 3. **No Queens (Jacks)**: -4 pts per Queen (or Jack) captured. 4. **No King of Hearts**: -8 pts for capturing the King of Hearts (The 'Hairy' King). 5. **No Last Trick**: -8 pts for winning the last trick. 6. **The Lora**: A shedding round. Players play cards in sequences (like Fan-Tan). First to empty their hand wins points. 7. **Negative Lora**: Inverse of round 6. 8. **Double Negative**: Points from all previous rounds combined into one super-avoidance round.",
    objective: 'Score the fewest points in negative rounds and most in positive rounds.',
    gameplay: "Eight rounds played in sequence: 1. **No Tricks**: -1 pt per trick won. 2. **No Hearts**: -1 pt per Heart captured. 3. **No Queens (Jacks)**: -4 pts per Queen (or Jack) captured. 4. **No King of Hearts**: -8 pts for capturing the King of Hearts (The 'Hairy' King). 5. **No Last Trick**: -8 pts for winning the last trick. 6. **The Lora**: A shedding round. Players play cards in sequences (like Fan-Tan). First to empty their hand wins points. 7. **Negative Lora**: Inverse of round 6. 8. **Double Negative**: Points from all previous rounds combined into one super-avoidance round.",
    keyRules: [
      'Standard trick-taking: Must follow suit. No trumps (except in specific variations).',
      'Rounds 1-5, 8 are negative (avoid points).',
